,"key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","近代物理","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7ffdef9ead072b3d647c5992cf2524052c0d87e0c42f00c9e80d46dedae82191","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图，一质量为m的等腰直角棱镜被置于光滑的水平面上，其横截面底边BC长度为2L，\nBC所在底面上涂有特殊反射层，能完全反射入射光。以底边BC中点O为原点，在竖直平面建立直角坐标系xOy，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"0<x\\leq L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的区域有一匀强激光场，频率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu"},{"type":"text","value":" 的单色光沿y轴负方向入射，单位时间内入射的光子数为N，棱镜对单色光的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，D点在底边BC上， "},{"type":"math","value":"OD=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}L"},{"type":"text","value":" 。棱镜初始时静止，不考虑经AB、AC内表面反射的光线\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d44cf337b45f06bdb09f4c72d70af621e03ba3ea7706e1c787ab320933692cca.png","width":653,"height":464,"width_mm":76.65,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A.从AC入射的光线可能经过D点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 经BC一次反射到AB出射的光线在玻璃砖中的传播时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}L}{3c}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 在AC面上涂上反射率为100%的反射膜，在初始时刻棱镜的加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"N\\frac{h\\nu}{mc}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 在AC面上涂上反射率为100%的反射膜，棱镜向左运动 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{L}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时的速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{\\frac{NLh\\nu}{mc}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"eeb3629e9c6731a743117eb093c0868be821fff40813e804466848bcf199082a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ两个题共14分）\n14-Ⅰ. （7分）某班同学分组设计验证机械能守恒实验，设计的装置如图甲、乙所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ba1d54df5c3ff84ea6b70a8f79ff51eba257f1c40a381e966bd65f738707fc89.png","width":1224,"height":366,"width_mm":143.933,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）甲组同学认为图甲装置在平衡摩擦力后即可验证机械能守恒定律，此方案（填空）（选填“可行”或“不可行”）\n(2) 乙组同学实验主要步骤有\nA. 将气垫导轨放在水平桌面上，将导轨调至水平；\nB. 测出遮光片的宽度 d；\nC. 用天平称出托盘和砝码的总质量 m；称出滑块和遮光片的总质量 M；\nD. 将滑块移至图示位置，测出遮光片到光电门的距离 L；\nE. 由静止释放滑块，读出遮光片通过光电门的遮光时间 t；\nF. 改变 L，多次重复实验，记录数据。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eee5802fefb3725e79c69cdbc8dbb1d63e89afe59058725ec89673dbae68f80a.png","width":460,"height":254,"width_mm":53.97,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c1c7acfe7cb9822cbe2ccf6d2b88272a68271a335717d3da2378127c6e48cd62.png","width":336,"height":348,"width_mm":39.511,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row2"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/12b0aeb32c1a3ed1cc8172e63f154b59f0fc046aeee919331e0b0749faf44c27.png","width":336,"height":354,"width_mm":39.511,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n①本实验的研究对象为（填空）\nA.滑块和遮光片 B.托盘和砝码 C.滑块和遮光片及托盘和砝码\n②如图丙所示，用游标卡尺测得遮光片的宽度 "},{"type":"math","value":"d="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n③作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"L - \\frac{1}{t^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像，如图丁所示，根据机械能守恒定律，图线斜率 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 的理论值为（填空） （用题中所给物理量的字母表示）。  \n④实验中有不可忽略的阻力影响，实际采集数据后作出了如图戊所示的图线（填空） （选填“A”或“B”）\n14-Ⅱ.（7分）某研究小组正在研究做一个简单的光控灯。\n（1）用多用电表的“×100"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"”挡测量某光照条件下的光敏电阻，如图1所示，此时光敏电阻的阻值为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":".\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a1c0708c5d12f162f24882a09021f752581a06523196b2820d674a41270fd40e.png","width":621,"height":321,"width_mm":73.025,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n（2）采用如图 2 电路精确测量光敏电阻的电阻值。图中 E 为干电池，S 为开关，\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{L}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为待测电阻， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为电阻箱（0～999999欧姆）， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{M}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为两个标识不清的定值电阻，G为灵敏电流计，电路中“+”“-”表示接线柱接线情况，图3为G表的表盘。K为按压开关，只有当按住时，所在电路才接通。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8600c20f12229fca2a19a0db3ee7b016e5f72b5451c5a614deab0a1bdd4c5046.png","width":367,"height":317,"width_mm":43.05,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a9941ba90154e2339000de3cea46bf1079522064f8a5cceabdf09d74eda2439a.png","width":383,"height":294,"width_mm":44.94,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/be91d21c089437d8a2e6d7622136492c2bb38837a630e3d0df43e665fa3174ba.png","width":370,"height":266,"width_mm":43.47,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图4\n①正确操作时，灵敏电流计应指向“0”位置。在某次测量时，按下K，发现灵敏电流计的指针向右偏，应该（填空）(选填“增大”或“减小”)电阻箱的阻值；\n②调节后，电阻箱如图4所示，此时电阻箱的阻值为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n③保持光照条件不变，交换 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{M}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的位置，重复①、②的操作，此时对应电阻箱的阻值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1800\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则本次测量中光敏电阻的值为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n（3）如图5，把光敏电阻与小灯泡固定在相对的支架上，并连接好各自电路，调节通过小灯泡的电流I，测得光敏电阻的阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{L}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与电流I的关系如图6所示。可以看出，随光照变强，光敏电阻的阻值（填空）（选填“增大”或“减小”）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e4bce42760600e8b5018dcfd7dcda2cd8247baa31701bf71f30c00ec819aeba9.png","width":460,"height":311,"width_mm":53.97,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图5\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6de279d531ea276e172b43f353bf020a1861e3efe7d0fe53f42156f5951727c8.png","width":333,"height":294,"width_mm":39.06,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图6\n（4）如图7所示是一种光控开关电路。图中用发光二极管LED模拟“路灯”， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\mathrm{L}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为光敏电阻、\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为发光二极管的限流电阻、VT为三极管。可调电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与光敏电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{L}"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成串联分压电路。整个电路接入到电压恒为3V的电路中，当三极管VT的b、e间电压达到0.7V后，发光二极管、三极管VT到达电源负极的回路被导通，二极管发光。若要使发光二极管在某一光照条件下发光，对应光敏电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{L}=1400\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则对应可调电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；要使发光二极管在更暗的条件下发光，应该把 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）。（选填“调大”或“调小”）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eed6c275138f62fff116539ddacbdfe33c2aa3042b0da1108fb6126b9bfa9176.png","width":537,"height":444,"width_mm":63.147,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q14-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图7"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-Ⅰ.（7分）【答案】\n（1）不可行（1分）\n（2）① C（1分）；② 5.1或5.2（2分）；③"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{(m+M)d^2}{2mg}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）；④ A（1分）。\n14-Ⅱ.（7分）【答案】\n（1）950（940～960均给分）（1分）\n（2）① 减小（1分）；② 200（1分）；③ 600（1分）\n（3）减小（1分）\n（4）4600（1分），调大（1分）。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"14ea6350a96cd61babbbcdd8a6aaf6c0934046af26b241b70ab49d1e2f2794f9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）取一个容积 "},{"type":"math","value":"V = 500\\mathrm{mL}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、瓶口截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 7\\times 10^{-4}\\mathrm{m}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的透明塑料瓶（忽略可能的体积变化），向瓶内注入少量的水（质量、体积忽略不计），将橡胶塞打孔，安装上气门嘴，再用橡胶塞把瓶口塞紧，已知橡胶塞与瓶口的最大静摩擦力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"f = 14\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。初始状态瓶中气体的压强与大气压相同，缓慢向瓶内打气，当瓶内压强达到某一值时，橡胶塞跳出瓶口，气体在极短的时间内喷出瓶口，气体喷出过程中与外界的热交换忽略不计。整个过程中环境的温度保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0} = 300\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变，大气压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_0 = 1.0\\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此状态下空气的密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho = 1.3\\mathrm{kg / m^3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，瓶内气体可看作理想气体。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c1fe24116a4bdd6ad16545217e87ac669b378e4532e952a9d08dd5ed60d49424.png","width":552,"height":334,"width_mm":64.89,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）瓶塞跳出过程中，气体分子的平均速率（填空）（选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”），气体分子对器壁单位面积的作用力（填空）（选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”）；\n（2）求瓶塞跳出时，打入气体的质量m；\n（3）已知气体喷出过程中对外界做功10.92 J，1 g空气的内能U=CT，C=0.7 J/K，求喷出气体过程中瓶内温度的减少量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta T"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）【答案】（1）变小，变小 （2）"},{"type":"math","value":"1.3 \\times 10^{-4}"},{"type":"text","value":"kg （3）20 K\n【解析】\n（1）瓶塞跳出过程中，气体对外做功且与外界没有热交换，故内能减小，温度降低，气体分子的平均速率变小（1分）；压强变小，故气体分子对器壁单位面积的作用力变小（1分）。\n（2）以瓶塞跳出瞬间瓶内气体为研究对象，看作体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的气体等温压缩到体积V、压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，有\n瓶塞跳出瞬间"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=p_{0}+\\frac{f}{S}=1.2\\times10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n等温过程"},{"type":"math","value":"p_0V_1 = p_1V"},{"type":"text","value":"代入得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}=600\\ mL"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n打入气体的质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m=\\rho(V_{1}-V)=1.3\\times10^{-4}kg"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) 研究对象为喷出前所有的气体, 故其总质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1} = \\rho V_{1} = 0.78g"},{"type":"text","value":"由热力学第一定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=Q+W"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），Q=0，故"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W=-10.92J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由已知条件，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta T = \\frac{|\\Delta U|}{m_1C} = 20K"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的单位用g）（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"df3578613276bcb70634cf1bddb571d4b8b0ad23c5f58318cbc7b2293be98f36","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）如图所示，带有半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （未知）的四分之一光滑圆弧轨道的小车置于光滑水平面上，小车质量M=4kg，圆弧最低点B离地高度h=1.65m。组合轨道由粗糙圆弧CD、传送带DE、水平光滑轨道EF、一底端开口且略微错开的竖直光滑圆轨道组成，圆弧CD的半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=6m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆心角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，传送带长度L=8m，F处竖直圆轨道半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{3}=2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。一质量m=2kg的滑块（视为质点）从圆弧轨道最高点A处静止释放，从B处水平飞出后恰好从C处无碰撞进入圆弧轨道CD，滑块滑至圆弧轨道最低点D时对轨道的压力为F=32N。已知滑块与传送带表面的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a5ab9722531699080b08e005c520a5cf32fc7eb9738bcf32fcd1c5bd9f4cf0e9.png","width":1134,"height":333,"width_mm":133.35,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）滑块运动到D点时的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n（2）滑块经过圆弧轨道CD过程中克服摩擦力做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）滑块释放时A点距C点的水平距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（4）若传送带以速度u顺时针匀速转动，要使滑块能在运动过程不脱离轨道，求传送带的速度u的取值范围。\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）【答案】（1）6 m/s （2）13 J （3）2 m （4）"},{"type":"math","value":"0 < u \\leq 2\\sqrt{10}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"u \\geq 10m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"【解析】\n(1) 在D点:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-mg=m\\frac{v_{D}^{2}}{R_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n代入得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}=6\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(2) B点离C的高度为："},{"type":"math","value":"h_{BC}=h-(R_{2}-R_{2}\\cos37^{\\circ})=0.45m"},{"type":"text","value":"则在C点："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{Cy}=\\sqrt{2gh_{BC}}=3m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}=5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n物体从C到D点"},{"type":"math","value":"mg(R_{2}-R_{2}\\cos37^{\\circ})-W_{f}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{C}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}=13J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B} = 4m / s"},{"type":"math","value":"mgR_1=\\frac{1}{2}mv_B^2+\\frac{1}{2}Mv_M^2,\\quad mv_B=Mv_M"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1} = 1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"Mx_1=m(R_1-x_1),\\quad x_1=0.4\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1} = R_{1} + v_{B}t - x_{1} = 2m"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（4）临界条件1：滑块不能到达竖直圆轨道等高点\n设滑块离开E点的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由机械能守恒定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E1}^2=mgR_3"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E1} = 2\\sqrt{10} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"临界条件2：滑块能经过竖直圆轨道最高点\n设滑块离开E点的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由机械能守恒定律\n在最高点，"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=\\frac{m{v'}^{2}}{R_3}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E2}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m{v'}^{2}+2mgR_3"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E2} = 10m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"考虑传送带的加速过程，若一直加速，滑块达到的最大速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_m=\\sqrt{v_D^2+2\\mu gL}=10\\,\\mathrm{m}/\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"故在临界条件1情形下，传送带速度应满足"},{"type":"math","value":"0 < u \\leq 2\\sqrt{10} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"故在临界条件2情形下，传送带速度应满足"},{"type":"math","value":"u \\geq 10m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"即传送带应满足条件"},{"type":"math","value":"0 < u \\leq 2\\sqrt{10}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"u \\geq 10m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n注：考虑从圆轨道滑回传送带的情况，其滑回初速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\sqrt{10} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"，无法回到D点。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8b50c9bccb239c558b0e5d20df1dd4eb78ffa17cfc22e5ea3a30dfb2c112c8e0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）如图所示，水平面内两根足够长的光滑金属导轨相距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，左侧分别接入内阻不计、电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E = 3\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电源和电容 "},{"type":"math","value":"C = 1\\mathrm{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电容器（初始不带电）。质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.01\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、长度略长于 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 10\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的导体棒静置于导轨上，且导体棒始终与导轨垂直。整个装置处于竖直向下的匀强磁场中，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = 0.5\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。不计导轨电阻以及回路自感，开关1、2断开。\n（1）仅闭合 1，求稳定后电容器所带电荷量 q；\n（2）先闭合1，稳定后断开1，再闭合2，求导体棒最终的速度v；\n（3）若同时闭合1、2，求导体棒从开始运动到速度恒定的过程中电源输出的电能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\text{电}}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（4）仅闭合2，给导体棒一个向右的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=10\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" 的同时，对导体棒施加向右的外力F，恰好使回路中电流I恒定且导体棒做匀加速运动，求加速度的大小a。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/630a15929c25f6d4c043387ea8fc868d27c70a93b32962a8e70d2ee524888d7c.png","width":601,"height":241,"width_mm":70.56,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q17-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（11分）（1）3 C（2）15 m/s（3）18 J（4）"},{"type":"math","value":"1\\,\\mathrm{m}/\\mathrm{s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"【转录注】答案原页标题印为11分，试卷题头为12分，原答案分项评分合计12分。\n【解析】\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"q = CE = 3\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"; (2分)\n(2) 设最终电容器两端电压为 U,\n则经过导体棒的电荷量为"},{"type":"math","value":"q'=C(E-U)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n对棒列动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"BLq'=mv"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n且终态满足 U=BLv（1分）\n故"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{CBLE}{m+CB^{2}L^{2}}=15\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"；（1分）\n（3）假设全过程经过电容器和导体棒的电荷量分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{1}=CE,\\quad BLq_{2}=mv_{2},\\quad E=BLv_{2},E_{\\text{电}}=E(q_{1}+q_{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"，（4个式子任意对一个得1分，最多得2分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\text{电}}=\\frac{m+CB^{2}L^{2}}{B^{2}L^{2}}E^{2}=18\\ J"},{"type":"text","value":"。（1分）\n（4）法一：电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{\\Delta q}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{C\\Delta u}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{C\\Delta(BLv-IR)}{\\Delta t}=CBLa,"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n初始时刻电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{BLv_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）\n联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{v_{0}}{RC}=1m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。 (1分)\n法二：回路满足BLv-u=IR，速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_{0}+at"},{"type":"text","value":"，电压"},{"type":"math","value":"u=\\frac{q}{C}=\\frac{It}{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"BL(v_{0}+at)-\\frac{It}{C}=IR,"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n上式恒成立，有"},{"type":"math","value":"BLv_{0}=IR,\\quad BLa=\\frac{I}{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{v_{0}}{RC}=1m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。 (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiyang-lianyi-2511","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"673be895393518705e58a9f13453d924c25eca1bc35796454f5974a46bc1a1d7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）1934年，约里奥-居里夫妇用"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left({}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" 轰击铝箔 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left({}^{27}_{13}\\mathrm{Al}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，生成了磷30 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left({}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}"},{"type":"text","value":" 具有天然放射性，释放出正电子 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left({}^{0}_{1}\\mathrm{e}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，转变为硅(Si)。如图是正电子穿过云室留下的径迹照片，中间是一块厚度很小的铅板，整个云室处在垂直纸面方向的匀强磁场中。已知图中虚线圆的半径为R，正电子从A点沿AO方向射入，经D点穿过铅板后速度方向不变，到达圆上的C点，点C、D、O在同一直线上，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"OD=\\frac{R}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，正电子的质量为m，电荷量为e，正电子进入云室的初动能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略相对论效应，忽略正电子在云室中受到的阻力，求\n（1）从 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 粒子轰击铝箔到产生正电子所经历的核反应方程式；\n(2) 云室中磁感应强度B的大小与方向;\n（3）粒子在穿过铅板过程中产生的热量Q；\n（4）已知射入云室的正电子的等效电流为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求此过程中铅板受到的水平向右的作用力F。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1e7a371d359830ada460d9a5ff178c05cbc154c7aa2cb4445582d42eccac0eca.png","width":607,"height":443,"width_mm":71.19,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2511-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）【答案】（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{27}_{13}\\mathrm{Al}\\rightarrow{}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n},\\quad{}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}\\rightarrow{}^{30}_{14}\\mathrm{Si}+{}^{0}_{1}\\mathrm{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{5}\\frac{\\sqrt{2E_{0}m}}{eR}"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{15}{16} E_0"},{"type":"text","value":"(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3I_{0}}{5e}\\sqrt{2mE_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"【解析】\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{27}_{13}\\mathrm{Al}\\rightarrow{}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)，"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{30}_{15}\\mathrm{P}\\rightarrow{}^{30}_{14}\\mathrm{Si}+{}^{0}_{1}\\mathrm{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(2) 由左手定则知，磁场方向垂直纸面向里。"},{"type":"math","value":"(r - y) ^ {2} + R ^ {2} = r ^ {2} \\quad y = \\frac {1}{3} R"},{"type":"text","value":"求得"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{5}{3}R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=m\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入得"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{3}{5}\\frac{\\sqrt{2E_{0}m}}{eR}"},{"type":"text","value":"。（1分）\n（3）由题意知，穿过铅板后，粒子的运动半径满足"},{"type":"math","value":"2r'\\cos37^\\circ=\\frac{2}{3}R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）即"},{"type":"math","value":"r'=\\frac{5}{12}R"},{"type":"text","value":"。（1分）\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"qv'B=m\\frac{v'^{2}}{r'}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"E'=\\frac{1}{2}mv'^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，求得"},{"type":"math","value":"E'=\\frac{1}{16}E_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=E_{0}-E'=\\frac{15}{16}E_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}=Ne"},{"type":"text","value":"，即单位时间经过铅板的正电子数为"},{"type":"math","value":"N=\\frac{I_{0}}{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"-F\\Delta t=N\\Delta t\\,m(v'\\cos37^\\circ-v_0\\cos37^\\circ)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{3}{5}Nmv_0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{3}{5}\\frac{I_{0}}{e}\\sqrt{2mE_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
